      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mover><mi>A</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mover><mi>B</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>R</mi><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>θ</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math>",
